ported Kalibr target-extraction logic in kalibr_extractor/ are from Kalibr
(ETH Zurich, Autonomous Systems Lab) and remain under their own BSD license,
see tool/fast_calib_offline_gui/kalibr_extractor/third_party/KALIBR_LICENSE
and the package.xml of ethz_apriltag2.

The public calibration sessions fetched by experiments/public/fetch_datasets.sh
keep the licenses of their sources (OpenCV: Apache-2.0; OpenCalib: Apache-2.0;
ROS image_pipeline sample data: BSD).
